OL,3,GNEWSA'Time and money wasted' as police
OL,4,Asent to court without testifying
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2024-25, the hours attributed to
OL,7,Fpolice attendance at court equated to
OL,8,Falmost 18,500 average working days, or
OL,9,F#4m.
